---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getSite } from '../lib/site';

const { careersEmail } = getSite();
---
<Layout
  title="Careers"
  description="Careers at Bycon — we build operations software for transportation. Reach out if you want to help."
>
  <article class="prose">
    <h1>Careers</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Bycon is building serious operations tools for transportation networks—primarily a transport management platform
      for brokers and providers in NEMT and adjacent markets. We value clarity, ownership, and respect for the people
      who run trips every day.
    </p>
    <h2>Open roles</h2>
    <p>
      We post specific openings here when they are active. If you do not see a match but believe you would strengthen
      the team, send a short note and a résumé or link to your work.
    </p>
    <p>
      <a href={`mailto:${careersEmail}?subject=Careers%20inquiry`}>{careersEmail}</a>
    </p>
    <h2>What to expect</h2>
    <p>
      We are a small, product-focused company. You will work across problem spaces—product, customer success, and
      reliable systems—without heavy ceremony. We care that software holds up in the field and in audits, not just in a
      slide deck.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
